    "description": "Available are raster files for the production of maps on the potential distribution of Allocebus trichotis in Madagascar. Three raw ENMs are available produced with literature data only, occurrence data only and a combination of both datasets. We further provide the modeled fundamental niche, the Extent of Occurrence and Area of Occupancy of A. trichotis.",
